WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.629
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Sarah. Welcome to Online A one, Book three.

2
00:00:05.929 --> 00:00:09.164
Hi! I'm Rithy. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:09.464 --> 00:00:16.401
Unit fifteen: Healthy Habits. In this unit, you will talk about how often you do healthy things.

4
00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:18.162
Healthy.

5
00:00:18.862 --> 00:00:20.955
Healthy means good for your body.

6
00:00:21.255 --> 00:00:22.709
Fruit is healthy food.

7
00:00:23.409 --> 00:00:26.351
Your turn. Say: Healthy.

8
00:00:29.051 --> 00:00:29.867
Healthy.

9
00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:31.700
Sleep.

10
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:35.224
Sleep means to rest with your eyes closed at night.

11
00:00:35.524 --> 00:00:37.198
I sleep for nine hours.

12
00:00:37.898 --> 00:00:40.388
Your turn. Say: Sleep.

13
00:00:43.088 --> 00:00:43.915
Sleep.

14
00:00:44.917 --> 00:00:46.104
Exercise.

15
00:00:46.804 --> 00:00:49.802
Exercise means to move your body to keep fit.

16
00:00:50.102 --> 00:00:52.089
I exercise every morning.

17
00:00:52.789 --> 00:00:55.825
Your turn. Say: Exercise.

18
00:00:58.525 --> 00:00:59.572
Exercise.

19
00:01:00.583 --> 00:01:01.457
Water.

20
00:01:02.157 --> 00:01:04.574
Water means the drink your body needs most.

21
00:01:04.874 --> 00:01:06.363
Drink lots of water.

22
00:01:07.063 --> 00:01:10.168
Your turn. Say: Water.

23
00:01:12.868 --> 00:01:13.695
Water.

24
00:01:14.683 --> 00:01:15.719
Vegetables.

25
00:01:16.419 --> 00:01:20.416
Vegetables means plants we eat, like carrots and beans.

26
00:01:20.716 --> 00:01:22.692
I eat vegetables every day.

27
00:01:23.392 --> 00:01:26.381
Your turn. Say: Vegetables.

28
00:01:29.081 --> 00:01:30.140
Vegetables.

29
00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:32.279
Wash hands.

30
00:01:32.979 --> 00:01:36.325
Wash hands means to clean your hands with soap and water.

31
00:01:36.625 --> 00:01:38.590
Wash your hands before you eat.

32
00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:42.012
Your turn. Say: Wash hands.

33
00:01:44.712 --> 00:01:45.875
Wash hands.

34
00:01:46.883 --> 00:01:47.931
Brush teeth.

35
00:01:48.631 --> 00:01:51.919
Brush teeth means to clean your teeth with a toothbrush.

36
00:01:52.219 --> 00:01:54.521
I brush my teeth twice a day.

37
00:01:55.221 --> 00:01:57.908
Your turn. Say: Brush teeth.

38
00:02:00.608 --> 00:02:01.528
Brush teeth.

39
00:02:02.517 --> 00:02:03.332
Habit.

40
00:02:04.032 --> 00:02:06.322
Habit means something you do often.

41
00:02:06.622 --> 00:02:08.424
Reading is a good habit.

42
00:02:09.124 --> 00:02:11.602
Your turn. Say: Habit.

43
00:02:14.302 --> 00:02:14.978
Habit.

44
00:02:15.983 --> 00:02:18.180
Now let's listen to a conversation.

45
00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:21.269
Rithy, how often do you brush your teeth?

46
00:02:22.583 --> 00:02:24.931
I always brush my teeth twice a day.

47
00:02:26.217 --> 00:02:28.602
Great! Do you eat sweets?

48
00:02:29.917 --> 00:02:33.286
I sometimes eat sweets, but not every day.

49
00:02:34.583 --> 00:02:36.130
And do you go to bed late?

50
00:02:37.417 --> 00:02:40.789
No, I never go to bed late. I sleep early.

51
00:02:42.083 --> 00:02:46.396
Grammar focus: How often? always and sometimes and never.

52
00:02:46.696 --> 00:02:50.498
I always brush my teeth. I sometimes eat sweets.

53
00:02:50.798 --> 00:02:55.700
Put always, sometimes and never before the main verb: I always brush my teeth.

54
00:02:56.683 --> 00:02:59.626
Now read and listen. Strong and Healthy.

55
00:02:59.926 --> 00:03:01.809
Healthy habits keep me strong.

56
00:03:03.117 --> 00:03:05.871
I always sleep early and wake up early.

57
00:03:07.183 --> 00:03:11.319
I exercise every day, and I drink lots of water.

58
00:03:12.617 --> 00:03:15.232
I always wash my hands before I eat.

59
00:03:16.517 --> 00:03:20.861
I sometimes eat sweets, but I never forget to brush my teeth.

60
00:03:22.150 --> 00:03:25.058
Quiz time! Choose the correct answer.

61
00:03:25.358 --> 00:03:28.602
I blank brush my teeth. (100%)

62
00:03:28.902 --> 00:03:33.229
A, always. B, never. C, sometimes.

63
00:03:37.217 --> 00:03:39.530
The answer is A: always.

64
00:03:41.017 --> 00:03:43.994
I blank go to bed late. (0%)

65
00:03:44.294 --> 00:03:49.352
A, always. B, sometimes. C, never.

66
00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:56.232
The answer is C: never.

67
00:03:57.717 --> 00:03:59.972
Something you do often is a blank.

68
00:04:00.272 --> 00:04:03.437
A, habit. B, vegetable. C, tooth.

69
00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:09.542
The answer is A: habit.

70
00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:14.631
Now it's your turn to speak. Which healthy habit do you have?

71
00:04:19.931 --> 00:04:25.019
I always wash my hands before I eat, and I sometimes play football after school.

72
00:04:25.319 --> 00:04:27.017
Excellent answer, Rithy!

73
00:04:28.017 --> 00:04:33.899
Great work today! You learned eight new words and how often? always and sometimes and never.

74
00:04:34.199 --> 00:04:39.174
Today's value is self-care. Look after yourself and rest when you are sick.

75
00:04:39.474 --> 00:04:42.439
See you in Unit sixteen. Goodbye!

76
00:04:42.739 --> 00:04:45.334
Thank you, Ms. Sarah! Bye, everyone!

